#undef NDEBUG
// Review GV: pm4py's frame DFG over an upload's start_timestamp column on
// the other routes and shapes.
//
// - /api/dfg-dataframe on a start column of no dates: frequency in the
//   column's pandas order (each value's rank, the gaps last), the
//   subtraction TypeError for performance, the .dt AttributeError with
//   business hours.
// - The lazy shape (mining_input_shape=lazyframe, pm4py on the frame's
//   Polars copy): the process map in Polars' unstable sort order, nulls
//   first, whole-second clamped durations; a start column of no dates fails
//   resolving the plan (the copy's dtype: i64, u64 cast to i64, f64, str,
//   bool). The DFG performance variant with business hours: the UDF's
//   replace() error on a numeric start, the Float64 SchemaError on the
//   first int duration (also without a start column), a uint64 start's
//   strict cast failure.
// - /api/playout classic on a frame DFG: pm4py's KeyError when a popped
//   activity has no outgoing edge and is no end activity.
//
// Expected values are pm4py 2.7.22 black-box on the same inputs
// (review-harness round-gv: tc/mkgv.py, ct/*.py).
//
// Usage: minera_server_review_gv_tests <minera_server>

